<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_ticket> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/AgentOntology/ticket> .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_ticket> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A material information bearer that is a ticket and bears information authorizing travel associated with a rail journey."@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#railway_station> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#railway_station> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "railway station"@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#railway_station> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040> .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#railway_station> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A material entity comprising physical railway facilities at which rail journeys begin, end, or pause, potentially including platforms, track infrastructure, structures, and buildings."@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#specifies_rail_journey> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#specifies_rail_journey> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_journey_plan> .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#specifies_rail_journey> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "specifies rail journey"@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#specifies_rail_journey> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_journey> .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#specifies_rail_journey> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A relation between a rail journey plan and the rail journey specified by that plan."@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#train> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#train> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "train"@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#train> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040> .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#train> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A material entity composed of one or more rail vehicles operated together on a railway to convey passengers or freight."@en .
